<WorkspaceSectionLayout
  eyebrow="Execution evidence"
  title="Runs"
  description="A truthful placeholder for future execution history and audit evidence."
>
  <h2>No live or persisted runs</h2>
  <p>Claude and Codex adapters currently compile provider-specific prompt previews only. The workspace does not call either provider, create branches, run repair loops, merge, deploy, or write runtime audit data to durable storage.</p>
  <p>See <a href="/docs/architecture/observability-and-audit/">Observability and audit</a> for the approved target boundary.</p>
</WorkspaceSectionLayout>
